        {
          "text": "Lino imbungano yoonse yakatanga cizuminano amwami muŋanda ya-Leza, Jehoyada wakabaambila kuti, Ngooyu mwana wamwami. Aendelezye cisi, mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakaamba aabana ba-Davida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
