        {
          "text": "Lino mbuboobu mbumweelede kucita, Akati kandinywe nubapaizi aba-Levi banjila buzuba bwa-Sabata, kube inkamu zyotatwe: inkamu imwi babe basikulindila milyango, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
