        },
        {
          "text": "Kutabi muntu uunjila muŋanda ya-Jehova cita bapaizi babeleka milimo aba-Levi, Aba baleelede kunjila nkaambo balasalala, pele bantu bamwi boonse baleelede kucita mbwaakalailila Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba-Levi baleelede kumuzyunguluka mwami, umwi aumwi uli azilwisyo zyakwe mujanza lyakwe, nkabela kufumbwa muntu uunjila mukati kaŋanda uleelede kujayigwa. Amube amwami ciindi cakunjila aciindi cakuzwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
