        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ba-Levi aba-Juda boonse bakacita mbubonya mbuli Jehoyada mupaizi mbwaakalailila. Bakaletelela umwi aumwi bantu bankamu yakwe ibakali kunjila buzuba bwa-Sabata abakali kuzwa buzuba bwa-Sabata, nkaambo Jehoyada mupaizi takwakamwaisya inkamu zyabantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Jehoyada mupaizi wakaaba mumaanza aabasilutwe masumo azikwabilizyo antobo izyakali zyamwami Davida izyakali muŋanda ya-Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela wakabika bantu boonse, umwi aumwi uli acilwisyo cakwe mujanza lyakwe, kuzwa kulubazu lwalulyo lwaŋanda mane kusikila kulubazu lwalumwensi lwaŋanda, cakuzyungul uka cipaililo aŋanda, kuti balangile mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
