        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakagwisya mwana wamwami, wamubikila munsini, wamupa mabuku aamulongo, aboobo bakamupa bwami. Nkabela Jehoyada abana bakwe bakamunanika, baamba kuti, Aongole mwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
