        {
          "text": "Nkabela alange buyo, wakabona mwami uliimvwi acilende cakwe kumanjililo, abasilutwe abasimyeembo bali kumbali lyamwami, abantu boonse bacisi balasekelela akulizya myeembo, abasikwiimba bali aziimbyo zyabo akwiisya bantu kutembaula, elyo Ataliya wakadeluula zyakusama zyakwe, walila kuti, Ndaabwa! Ndaabwa! ",
          "type": "text",
