        {
          "text": "Mpawo Jehoyada wakaita basilutwe bamyanda ibakali kubamba impi, wabaambila kuti, Amumutandile anze lyamindando yabantu; kufumbwa muntu uumutobela ajayigwe apanga, Nkaambo mupaizi wakati, Mutamujayili muŋanda ya-Jehova. ",
