        {
          "text": "Alimwi Jehoyada wakabika bantu kuti balindile iŋanda ya-Jehova. Bakali mumaanza aabapaizi ba-Levi, Davida mbaakabikide kukubeleka milimo yaŋanda ya-Jehova, kuti batuulile Jehova zipaizyo mbubonya mbukulembedwe mubbuku lya-Musa, akusekelela akwiimba mbubonya mbwaakalailila Davida. ",
