        {
          "text": "Elyo wakatolelela basilutwe abapati abasikweendelezya bantu abantu boonse banyika, nkabela bakagwisya mwami muŋanda yaJehova, bainda kumulyango wakujulu kuya kuŋanda yamwami, babika mwami acuuno cabwami. ",
